      "id": "R3",
      "severity": "requires_domain_review",
      "scope": "C1",
      "finding": "Cooling-to-24 effect, 6000 ms duration, and 1.4 kW are synthetic; the energy task has no explicit peak window or quantitative service goal. The safe arm changes task release time by design."
    },
    {
      "id": "R4",
      "severity": "requires_domain_review",
      "scope": "C3",
      "finding": "0.5 kW study light, 1.0 kW HVAC, action durations, and whether the limit is whole-home or circuit capacity lack physical sources. The capacity threshold is not visible in individual Agent requests, so model comparisons must disclose the information asymmetry."
    },
